<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to attack civilians in Nigeria's Plateau region, killing a 60-year-old woman harvesting groundnuts and injuring two farmers, while separate Fulani attackers killed a farmer and wounded another. In the north-east, unknown gunmen killed at least ten villagers in a raid after Friday prayers, with later reports of the death toll rising to forty. Bandits abducted two farmers in Kaduna community. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPZmRPZDZzc3M0RTNvT0M4LU4tRVhWMDA5NXFMajBlSWFiZnBpZkF1UFQtdTFDbkQ1ZmpOaDJaOWRVdElsenlzX1JacjJkTVJpQTJCRlBKQmRLLUVwNnNBWkpBLTZ5eFM2X3pRTHRGNEF3cnUtNUw2dGstM3kxWktfVjlLREM5QTRpTmFqa3h0LU5hbU9TZWZqOUgwbXp4MDU2emc?oc=5&quot;&gt;News On AIR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNMkhtck1fSk1xWkVHbjNQcGw5eHRKTGFFS2dWSVh3TVRMLVJVdV9JWjl0dzNWSFZDRldxeUc4WVlJQWxHcjZ0NGs4Q1FPdGVqRFEtZF83WUp2VjFDSm1nS0J6MXN6el9iSU12dlJCT3JYLVpUQzhkWnVoYmYwb0dJUWgtU1FNZS03QzlVNHA5RUpiSnZOV3FFbmZlSVBrbWtubGRBcWFvT2MyVzctMTRhRW